{"page": 1376, "total_pages": 1421, "total": 71025, "skills": [{"category": "education", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781171845664, "description": "混沌课程学习与创新工具 - 搜索混沌课程、学习路径规划、课程文稿解读，以及商业创新工具（价值提亮、创意爆破、卖点创新、精准定价、以小博大）", "description_zh": "混沌课程学习与创新工具 - 搜索混沌课程、学习路径规划、课程文稿解读，以及商业创新工具（价值提亮、创意爆破、卖点创新、精准定价、以小博大）", "downloads": 40, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_e4e0ae9d/hundun-skill", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/2d8152d9-7618-454e-9d87-2487f1b4457f.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "混沌创新技能", "ownerName": "user_e4e0ae9d", "score": 325.89212970506765, "slug": "hundun-skill", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [{"key": "edu-tutoring", "name": "学习辅导"}, {"key": "edu-course-design", "name": "课程设计"}, {"key": "edu-teaching-aid", "name": "教学辅助"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781983365140, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.2"}, {"category": "life-service", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781166498785, "description": "Using the built-in microphone of a baby monitor or smart camera to capture infant cry audio, AI acoustic analysis extracts cry features such as frequency, pitch, rhythm, and duration, and classifies the possible causes behind the cry (hunger, sleepiness, pain/discomfort, boredom/need for comfort, fear, etc.), outputting the most likely cause and its confidence. | 通过婴儿监护器或智能摄像头的内置麦克风采集婴儿哭声音频，利用AI声学分析技术提取哭声的频率、音调、节奏、持续时间等特征，分类识别婴儿哭声背后的可能原因（饥饿、困倦、疼痛/不适、无聊/需要安抚、恐惧等），输出最可能的原因类别及置信度。系统实时监测哭声，当检测到哭声时自动分析并在父母手机APP上推送结果（如'宝宝可能是饿了，建议喂奶'）。", "description_zh": "Using the built-in microphone of a baby monitor or smart camera to capture infant cry audio, AI acoustic analysis extracts cry features such as frequency, pitch, rhythm, and duration, and classifies the possible causes behind the cry (hunger, sleepiness, pain/discomfort, boredom/need for comfort, fear, etc.), outputting the most likely cause and its confidence. | 通过婴儿监护器或智能摄像头的内置麦克风采集婴儿哭声音频，利用AI声学分析技术提取哭声的频率、音调、节奏、持续时间等特征，分类识别婴儿哭声背后的可能原因（饥饿、困倦、疼痛/不适、无聊/需要安抚、恐惧等），输出最可能的原因类别及置信度。系统实时监测哭声，当检测到哭声时自动分析并在父母手机APP上推送结果（如'宝宝可能是饿了，建议喂奶'）。", "downloads": 40, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_bb47e3e3/infant-cry-cause-classification-analysis", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/c0bd7863-2689-46f1-941c-e45be1317e90.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "smyx_infant_cry_cause_classification_analysis | 婴幼儿哭声原因分类", "ownerName": "user_bb47e3e3", "score": 562.0345651257552, "slug": "infant-cry-cause-classification-analysis", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [{"key": "life-health", "name": "健康管理"}, {"key": "life-family", "name": "家庭助手"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781983364935, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "ai-agent", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781191885967, "description": "AI-powered plant wilting quantification from full-plant images via smart pots or fixed cameras. Detects leaf-stem angle (leaf droop), stem straightness, and leaf turgidity to quantify wilting severity (0-100%). Optionally fuses soil-moisture sensor data to discriminate dehydration (underwatering) vs. waterlogging (root hypoxia), and auto-triggers watering or drainage prompts for precision irrigation. Scenarios: smart pots, home gardening, greenhouses, plant factories. | 通过智能花盆或固定摄像头拍摄植物整体图像，利用AI视觉分析技术检测叶片与茎秆的夹角（叶片下垂角度）、茎秆挺直程度以及叶片舒展度，量化萎蔫程度（0-100%）。可选结合土壤湿度传感器数据，综合判断萎蔫原因是缺水还是水涝（根部缺氧导致）。可自动触发灌溉或排水提示，帮助用户精准浇水。应用场景：智能花盆、家庭园艺、温室大棚、植物工厂。", "description_zh": "AI-powered plant wilting quantification from full-plant images via smart pots or fixed cameras. Detects leaf-stem angle (leaf droop), stem straightness, and leaf turgidity to quantify wilting severity (0-100%). Optionally fuses soil-moisture sensor data to discriminate dehydration (underwatering) vs. waterlogging (root hypoxia), and auto-triggers watering or drainage prompts for precision irrigation. Scenarios: smart pots, home gardening, greenhouses, plant factories. | 通过智能花盆或固定摄像头拍摄植物整体图像，利用AI视觉分析技术检测叶片与茎秆的夹角（叶片下垂角度）、茎秆挺直程度以及叶片舒展度，量化萎蔫程度（0-100%）。可选结合土壤湿度传感器数据，综合判断萎蔫原因是缺水还是水涝（根部缺氧导致）。可自动触发灌溉或排水提示，帮助用户精准浇水。应用场景：智能花盆、家庭园艺、温室大棚、植物工厂。", "downloads": 40, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_bb47e3e3/plant-wilting-quantification-analysis", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/0c9b068f-f22e-44e2-96fe-d2b6f5b43b07.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Plant Wilting Quantification (Underwatering / Overwatering) | 植物萎蔫程度量化（缺水/水多）", "ownerName": "user_bb47e3e3", "score": 264.0089763051944, "slug": "plant-wilting-quantification-analysis", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [{"key": "agent-task-automation", "name": "任务自动化"}, {"key": "agent-tool-use", "name": "工具调用"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781983364714, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "professional", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781485241130, "description": "模板支撑体系工程专项施工方案的详细评审。用于对模架施工方案进行逐项核查，包含九大章节的详细检查清单、跨章节一致性检测及规范版本有效性核查。当用户要求审核模板支撑体系、高大支模、模架等施工方案时调用。", "description_zh": "模板支撑体系工程专项施工方案的详细评审。用于对模架施工方案进行逐项核查，包含九大章节的详细检查清单、跨章节一致性检测及规范版本有效性核查。当用户要求审核模板支撑体系、高大支模、模架等施工方案时调用。", "downloads": 40, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_d9e8cccd/formwork-support-review", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/9bcddb03-161b-42cd-bf2e-cf0159d85bd7.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key"